---
import { ArrowUpRight, Feather, BookOpen, Heart } from '@lucide/astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Margins — A place for words" description="The thought behind Margins, an independent home for stories and books." current="about">
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="about-hero section-shell"><span class="eyebrow" data-intro>A NOTE ABOUT THIS PLACE</span><h1 data-intro>For the love<br />of <em>getting lost.</em></h1><p data-intro>Margins is an independent reading journal built around a simple belief: words can make the world feel larger, softer, and more full of possibility.</p><div class="about-hero-image" data-intro><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1500&q=85" alt="A writer's desk with notebooks and a fountain pen" /></div></section>
    <section class="about-manifesto section-shell"><div class="manifesto-aside"><Feather size={31} stroke-width={1.2} /><span>OUR SMALL<br />MANIFESTO</span></div><div class="manifesto-copy"><h2>Less noise.<br /><em>More meaning.</em></h2><p>We made this space for the pleasure of reading without rushing. For stories that open a window. For books that become part of the furniture of your life.</p><p>Here, a short story can sit beside a beloved classic. A new voice can share a shelf with an old favourite. The only rule is to stay curious.</p><a class="text-link" href="/stories/">Spend a little time with us <ArrowUpRight size={15} /></a></div></section>
    <section class="about-values"><div class="section-shell values-grid"><div><BookOpen size={24} /><span class="eyebrow">01 — READ WITH CURIOSITY</span><h3>Follow the words.</h3><p>Explore different voices, unexpected ideas, and stories that make you pause.</p></div><div><Heart size={24} /><span class="eyebrow">02 — KEEP WHAT MOVES YOU</span><h3>Make room for feeling.</h3><p>Some pages stay with us. We believe those are worth sharing.</p></div><div><Feather size={24} /><span class="eyebrow">03 — TAKE YOUR TIME</span><h3>There is no rush.</h3><p>Read one page or a hundred. This little corner will be here when you return.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="about-closing"><span>✳</span><h2>Turn the page.<br /><em>See where it takes you.</em></h2><a class="button button--ink" href="/books/">Explore the library <ArrowUpRight size={16} /></a></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>